          "question": "e-9484",
          "field": null,
          "attribute": "question/problem",
          "value": "Which of the following are partitions of the real interval $[1,9]?$\n\n- $\\{1, 4, 5, 8\\}$\n\n- $\\{1, 3, 4, 9\\}$\n\n- $1 <     2  <    9$",
