        {
          "question": "e-9481",
          "field": null,
          "attribute": "question/problem",
          "value": "Let $P = \\left\\{x_0, x_1, \\ldots, x_m\\right\\}$ be a partition of the interval $[-3, 4].$ If $\\Delta x_i = x_i - x_{i-1},$ calculate $\\displaystyle\\sum_{i=1}^m (x_i + x_{i-1})\\Delta x_i .$",
          "category": "ma_capture",
